<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada excess settlement balances.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada excess settlement balances.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada's computed cumulative excess settlement balance for the period July 17 to July 23 was C$149 million, the Bank said on Friday.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
